items.CBD_Crimson_Oath_Effigy.name = Effigy of the Crimson Oath
items.CBD_Crimson_Oath_Effigy.description = Ebony-dark plates close around a faceless sentinel, its twin fangs lowered in the reverse grip of the Crimson Brotherhood. A black hand marks its divided crimson shroud. Those who kneel before it swear that no oath is broken while the silent watcher stands.
items.CBD_Twin_Fangs_Covenant.name = Altar of the Twin Fangs
items.CBD_Twin_Fangs_Covenant.description = A pointed black arch encloses a crimson sigil-stone, recalling the dread gates of Mehrunes Dagon. Two hooked fangs bow beneath it, their edges stained by a covenant no living tongue will name. The Brotherhood leaves its final offerings between them.
items.CBD_Black_Hand_Banner.name = Banner of the Fivefold Silence
items.CBD_Black_Hand_Banner.description = Five black fingers rise upon deep crimson, framed by forged talons and funeral cloth. Beneath this sign of the Black Hand, names are surrendered, vows are whispered, and the silence of the sanctuary is kept.
items.CBD_Silent_Mother_Reliquary.name = Reliquary of the Silent Mother
items.CBD_Silent_Mother_Reliquary.description = Behind black iron ribs and a crimson wax seal, a veiled matron lies beneath the five-fingered mark. Votive candles keep their low vigil for the Night Mother, while the Brotherhood entrusts its whispered petitions to the listening dark of Sithis.
